cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the CS-WER metric, please cite the paper below."
title: "Dynamic Block-Online Streaming ASR for Low-Resource Agglutinative Code-Switching Speech with Morphology-Aware Evaluation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of Fine-Grained CS-WER (E_switch / E_root / E_morph),
  a morphology-aware evaluation metric for Bangla-English intra-sentential
  code-switching, together with the 737-entry loanword lexicon used for
  Script-Anchored Loanword Injection.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/King-Rafat/Dynamic_Streaming_ASR"
keywords:
  - speech recognition
  - streaming ASR
  - code-switching
  - agglutinative morphology
  - Bangla
  - low-resource languages
  - CS-WER

